     1752                 Counter1 @ RecordsDone
     1753                 WITH FRAME InfoFrame.
     1754              end.
     1755   End.
     1756      if v-button-stop then  DO:
     1757            if mFrameView
     1758            then
     1759               PROCESS EVENTS.
     1760            IF StopProcessing THEN DO:
     1761            RETURN error.
     1762            End.
     1763      end.
     1764     find first temp-goods where temp-goods.gds-code = buf_gds-obj.gds-code no-error .
     1765     if not available temp-goods then do:
